            { title = 'Goldsmithing 80–90', note = '• Golden Spear (cap 82): Fire Crystal + Gold Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 115500 gil), Mercury (Odoba, Bastok Mines, 1700 gil), Partisan (Khifo Ryuhkowa, Kazham, 82110 gil)\n• Rapier (cap 83), also needs Smithing 28: Fire Crystal + 2 × Steel Ingot (Amulya, Metalworks, 26250 gil), Gold Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 115500 gil), Fluorite (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 156000 gil), Mercury (Odoba, Bastok Mines, 1700 gil)\n• Platinum Rod (cap 86): Fire Crystal + Steel Ingot (Amulya, Metalworks, 26250 gil), Gold Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 115500 gil), Platinum Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 292500 gil)\n• Ruby Earring (cap 85): Earth Crystal + Ruby (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 304000 gil), Platinum Earring (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 399000 gil)' },
            { title = 'Goldsmithing 90–100', note = '• Muscle Belt (cap 92): Fire Crystal + Brass Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 1000 gil), Gold Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 115500 gil), Manticore Lth. (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 55900 gil)\n• Sapphire Ring (cap 95): Earth Crystal + Sapphire (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 304000 gil), Platinum Ring (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 434000 gil)\n• Diamond Ring (cap 95): Earth Crystal + Diamond (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 304000 gil), Platinum Ring (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 434000 gil)\n• Ruby Ring (cap 95): Earth Crystal + Ruby (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 304000 gil), Platinum Ring (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 434000 gil)' },
            { title = 'Goldsmithing 100–110', note = '• Amood (cap 101), also needs Smithing 43, Woodworking 41: Fire Crystal + 2 × Mythril Ingot (Amulya, Metalworks, 50000 gil), Darksteel Ingot (Amulya, Metalworks, 142500 gil), Ebony Lumber (Chaupire, Northern San d\'Oria, 64000 gil), Gold Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 115500 gil), Turquoise (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 60000 gil), 2 × Scintillant Ingot\n• Thunder Ring (cap 102): Earth Crystal + Lightning Bead, Orichalcum Ring\n• Soil Ring (cap 102): Earth Crystal + Earth Bead, Orichalcum Ring\n• Dark Ring (cap 102): Earth Crystal + Dark Bead, Orichalcum Ring' }
    } },
    { name = 'Clothcraft', group = 'Crafting', desc = 'In each band, synthesize one of these until it stops giving skill, then move on. Cheapest first, using Olympus XI\'s own recipes and shop prices; ingredients any new player can buy are preferred over ones a guild sells only at a higher craft rank. Merchant prices are base prices (nation fame can move some of them a little); guild shop prices are the most they charge.', steps = {
            { title = 'Clothcraft 0–10', note = '• Chocobo Fltchg. (cap 2): Wind Crystal + 2 × Chocobo Fthr. (Challoux, Port Jeuno, 8 gil)\n• Grass Thread (cap 3): Lightng. Crystal + 2 × Moko Grass (Albinie, Port San d\'Oria, 20 gil)\n• Grass Cloth (cap 4): Earth Crystal + 3 × Grass Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 300 gil)\n• Headgear (cap 5): Wind Crystal + Grass Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 300 gil), 2 × Grass Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 1600 gil)' },
            { title = 'Clothcraft 10–20', note = '• Cotton Thread (cap 11): Lightng. Crystal + 2 × Saruta Cotton (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 200 gil)\n• Red Grs. Thread (cap 15): Lightng. Crystal + 2 × Red Moko Grass (Gibol, Selbina, 200 gil, sold only to guild rank Recruit or higher)\n• Linen Thread (cap 19): Lightng. Crystal + 2 × Flax Flower (Denvihr, Port Bastok, 248 gil)\n• Flaxseed Oil (cap 19): Water Crystal + 2 × Flax Flower (Denvihr, Port Bastok, 248 gil)' },
            { title = 'Clothcraft 20–30', note = '• Yagudo Fltchg. (cap 22): Wind Crystal + 2 × Yagudo Feather (Antonian, Northern San d\'Oria, 41 gil)\n• Cotton Hachimaki (cap 21): Wind Crystal + 2 × Cotton Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 3200 gil)\n• Heko Obi (cap 27): Earth Crystal + Grass Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 300 gil), 2 × Cotton Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 3200 gil)\n• Cotton Tekko (cap 22), also needs Woodworking 6: Earth Crystal + Lauan Lumber (Chaupire, Northern San d\'Oria, 180 gil), Grass Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 300 gil), 2 × Cotton Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 3200 gil)' },
            { title = 'Clothcraft 30–40', note = '• Shinobi-Tabi (cap 34): Earth Crystal + Grass Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 300 gil), 2 × Cotton Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 3200 gil), Saruta Cotton (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 200 gil)\n• Wool Thread (cap 35): Lightng. Crystal + 2 × Sheep Wool (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 4500 gil)\n• Hawkeye (cap 35), also needs Goldsmithing 9: Wind Crystal + Silver Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 10500 gil), 2 × Yagudo Feather (Antonian, Northern San d\'Oria, 41 gil), Animal Glue (Gathweeda, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 600 gil)\n• Aht Urhgan Dart (cap 33), also needs Bonecraft 14: Wind Crystal + Animal Glue (Gathweeda, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 600 gil), 2 × Colibri Feather (Taten-Bilten, Al Zahbi, 4590 gil), Colibri Beak (Gathweeda, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 6250 gil)' },
            { title = 'Clothcraft 40–50', note = '• Bird Fletchings (cap 42): Wind Crystal + 2 × Bird Feather (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 40 gil)\n• Mohbwa Thread (cap 41): Lightng. Crystal + 2 × Mohbwa Grass (Gibol, Selbina, 800 gil, sold only to guild rank Apprentice or higher)\n• Hemp Gorget (cap 43): Earth Crystal + 8 × Grass Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 300 gil)\n• Velvet Cloth (cap 50): Earth Crystal + Silk Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 4060 gil), 2 × Cotton Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 800 gil)' },
            { title = 'Clothcraft 50–60', note = '• Silk Thread (cap 51): Lightng. Crystal + 2 × Crawler Cocoon (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 930 gil)\n• Karakul Thread (cap 55): Lightng. Crystal + 2 × Karakul Wool (Gibol, Selbina, 1400 gil, sold only to guild rank Journeyman or higher)\n• Silk Cloth (cap 53): Earth Crystal + 3 × Silk Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 4060 gil)\n• Silver Obi (cap 51): Earth Crystal + 3 × Silver Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 5000 gil)' },
            { title = 'Clothcraft 60–70', note = '• Apkal. Fletching (cap 67): Wind Crystal + 2 × Apkallu Feather (Taten-Bilten, Al Zahbi, 4590 gil)\n• Green Ribbon (cap 62): Wind Crystal + Silk Cloth (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 21000 gil)\n• Silk Headband (cap 69): Earth Crystal + Silk Cloth (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 21000 gil), Carbon Fiber (Gathweeda, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 6000 gil)\n• W. Puppet Turban (cap 70): Earth Crystal + Silver Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 5000 gil), Cotton Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 3200 gil), Silk Cloth (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 21000 gil)' },
            { title = 'Clothcraft 70–80', note = '• Blk. Chc. Fltchg. (cap 72): Wind Crystal + 2 × Black C. Feather (Neigepance, Bastok Mines, 1239 gil)\n• Pinwheel (cap 77), also needs Smithing 37: Wind Crystal + Steel Ingot (Amulya, Metalworks, 26250 gil), Animal Glue (Gathweeda, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 600 gil), 2 × Bast Parchment (Jabbar, Port Bastok, 5400 gil)\n• Jester\'s Cape (cap 74), also needs Leathercraft 20: Earth Crystal + Silk Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 4060 gil), 2 × Silk Cloth (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 21000 gil), 2 × Sheep Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 1000 gil)\n• Green Beret (cap 76): Earth Crystal + Silk Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 4060 gil), 2 × Silk Cloth (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 21000 gil), Chocobo Fthr. (Challoux, Port Jeuno, 8 gil), Giant Bird Fthr. (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 4590 gil)' },
            { title = 'Clothcraft 80–90', note = '• Wamoura Silk (cap 88): Lightng. Crystal + 2 × Wam. Cocoon (Taten-Bilten, Al Zahbi, 780 gil)\n• Puk Fletching (cap 82): Wind Crystal + 2 × Puk Wing (Taten-Bilten, Al Zahbi, 4590 gil)\n• War Brais (cap 83): Earth Crystal + Gold Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 114000 gil), 2 × Linen Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 15000 gil), Tiger Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 23040 gil)\n• Arhat\'s Hakama (cap 88): Earth Crystal + Silk Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 4060 gil), 2 × Velvet Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 79750 gil), Silk Cloth (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 21000 gil), 2 × Sheep Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 1000 gil)' },
            { title = 'Clothcraft 90–100', note = '• Errant Slops (cap 94), also needs Leathercraft 26: Earth Crystal + Rainbow Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 277200 gil), 2 × Velvet Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 79750 gil), 2 × Silk Cloth (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 21000 gil), Ram Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 18120 gil)\n• Errant Hat (cap 92), also needs Leathercraft 34, Goldsmithing 21: Earth Crystal + Pearl (Celestina, Mhaura, 11000 gil, sold only to guild rank Apprentice or higher), Rainbow Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 277200 gil), 2 × Velvet Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 79750 gil), Silk Cloth (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 21000 gil), 2 × Ram Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 18120 gil)\n• Errant Cuffs (cap 98), also needs Leathercraft 26, Goldsmithing 24: Earth Crystal + 2 × Turquoise (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 60000 gil), Gold Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 114000 gil), Silk Cloth (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 21000 gil), Rainbow Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 567675 gil), Sheep Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 1000 gil)\n• Dance Shoes (cap 98): Earth Crystal + Rainbow Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 277200 gil), Rainbow Cloth (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 567675 gil), Moccasins (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 204000 gil)' }
    } },
