            { title = 'Leathercraft 60–70', note = '• Tiger Leather (cap 61): Dark Crystal + Win. Tea Leaves (Baehu-Faehu, Windurst Waters, 20 gil), Tiger Hide (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 8750 gil), Distilled Water (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 12 gil)\n• Hard Leather Ring (cap 62): Wind Crystal + Tiger Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 23040 gil)\n• Beak Mantle (cap 63): Earth Crystal + Grass Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 300 gil), 2 × Cockatrice Skin (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 17670 gil)\n• Beak Jerkin (cap 69): Earth Crystal + Sheep Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 1000 gil), 2 × Cockatrice Skin (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 17670 gil)' },
