            { title = 'Leathercraft 80–90', note = '• Coeurl Mantle (cap 85): Ice Crystal + Wool Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 18000 gil), Coeurl Hide (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 18000 gil)\n• Coeurl Jerkin (cap 89): Earth Crystal + 2 × Coeurl Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 38610 gil), Sheep Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 1000 gil)\n• Coeurl Mask (cap 87): Earth Crystal + 2 × Coeurl Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 38610 gil), Faceguard (Brunhilde, Bastok Markets, 1450 gil)\n• Coeurl Ledelsens (cap 84), also needs Goldsmithing 23: Earth Crystal + Coeurl Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 38610 gil), Mythril Sheet (Amulya, Metalworks, 60000 gil), Cuir Highboots (Poporoon, Nashmau, 20532 gil)' },
            { title = 'Leathercraft 90–100', note = '• Cardinal Vest (cap 94), also needs Smithing 31, Clothcraft 21: Water Crystal + Steel Sheet (Amulya, Metalworks, 42000 gil), Gold Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 114000 gil), Ram Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 18120 gil), 2 × Tiger Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 23040 gil), Beeswax (Gathweeda, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 600 gil), 2 × Manticore Lth. (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 55900 gil)\n• Griffon Leather (cap 97): Dark Crystal + Win. Tea Leaves (Baehu-Faehu, Windurst Waters, 20 gil), Griffon Hide, Distilled Water (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 12 gil)\n• Amaltheia Lth. (cap 98): Dark Crystal + Win. Tea Leaves (Baehu-Faehu, Windurst Waters, 20 gil), Amaltheia Hide, Distilled Water (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 12 gil)\n• Desert Mantle (cap 92): Earth Crystal + Grass Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 300 gil), 2 × Yowie Skin' },
            { title = 'Leathercraft 100–110', note = '• Panther Mask (cap 103): Ice Crystal + Wool Thread (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 18000 gil), Ram Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 18120 gil), Wyvern Skin, 2 × H.Q. Coeurl Hide\n• Corselet (cap 101), also needs Smithing 60, Goldsmithing 60: Earth Crystal + Adaman Sheet, Mercury (Odoba, Bastok Mines, 1700 gil), Lm. Bf. Leather, Ovinnik Leather, Marid Leather, Marid Hair, Scintillant Ingot, Star Sapphire' }
